## Context

Child of tracker 1552. Runs `/replicate reproduce` on the Gavard Scotch
reproduction (`~/CNRS/papiers/actif/Gavard Scotch 2026 Climate finance
counterproductive/`, completed by hand, a known answer) plus 2 I4R papers.
Needs an execution environment: on 2026-11-25 doudou had neither Stata nor R,
and `replicator/docker/` was empty. Where it comes from (replicator's docker
image or the host) is an author decision, open.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] An R (and, if a chosen paper needs it, Stata) environment exists and is
      recorded where replicator's docs say.
- [ ] `reproduce` run on Gavard Scotch and 2 I4R papers; for the I4R papers,
      whether it finds I4R's recorded discrepancies.
- [ ] Results in `design/replicate-reproduce-validation-<date>.md`.
